---
import Policy from '../layouts/Policy.astro';
import { product, site } from '../site.config';
---

<Policy title="Shipping" description="Where Fox Fobz ships, how long it takes, and how tracking works.">
  <h2>Where we ship</h2>
  <p>We currently ship to addresses in the United States only, including APO/FPO/DPO addresses.</p>

  <h2>When your order ships</h2>
  <p>
    Orders ship {product.shippingWindow} after payment. Orders placed on weekends or holidays begin processing the next
    business day.
  </p>

  <h2>Carriers and cost</h2>
  <p>
    We ship with USPS or UPS. Shipping options and their cost are shown at checkout before you pay. Sales tax is
    calculated at checkout based on your shipping address.
  </p>

  <h2>Emails you’ll get</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Receipt</strong> — sent by our payment processor, Stripe, as soon as your payment goes through.</li>
    <li><strong>Tracking</strong> — sent when we buy your shipping label, with a link to follow the package.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Check your spam folder if you don’t see them. Both go to the email address you entered at checkout.</p>

  <h2>Address problems</h2>
  <p>
    Double-check your address at checkout. If you spot a mistake, email
    <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`}>{site.supportEmail}</a> right away — we can fix it until the label is printed.
    Packages returned to us as undeliverable because of an incorrect address can be reshipped at your cost.
  </p>

  <h2>Lost or damaged packages</h2>
  <p>
    If tracking stops moving for more than 7 days, shows delivered but you can’t find it, or the package arrives damaged,
    email us with your order details (and photos of any damage). We’ll work with the carrier and make it right.
  </p>
</Policy>
